    "zh": "名字和特征",
    "en": "Name and features",
    "ms": "Nama dan ciri"
   },
   "level": "basic",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:lepidoptera}}来自希腊文 lepis（鳞片）加 pteron（翅），意思是「鳞片翅」。",
      "en": "{{t:lepidoptera}} comes from the Greek lepis (scale) and pteron (wing): 'scale-winged'.",
      "ms": "{{t:lepidoptera}} berasal daripada bahasa Yunani lepis (sisik) dan pteron (sayap): 'bersayap sisik'."
     },
     "defines": [
      "lepidoptera"
     ],
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "ids": [
      "butterfly-graphium-antiphates",
      "moth-brahmaea",
      "plutella-xylostella-larva"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「鳞」就是鱼鳞：翅上盖满小鳞片。",
      "en": "Think 'scales': wings tiled like a fish.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'sisik': sayap bersisik seperti ikan."
     },
     "src": [
      "ETYM"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "两对翅盖满细小的鳞片，摸了会掉色粉",
       "en": "Two pairs of wings covered in tiny scales that rub off as coloured dust",
       "ms": "Dua pasang sayap diliputi sisik halus yang tertanggal seperti debu berwarna"
      },
      {
       "zh": "成虫的口器是一根卷起来的长吸管（虹吸式）",
       "en": "Adults feed through a long coiled tube (siphoning)",
       "ms": "Dewasa makan melalui tiub panjang bergulung (menyedut)"
      },
      {
       "zh": "幼虫是毛虫，用咀嚼式口器吃叶子",
       "en": "Larvae are caterpillars that chew leaves",
       "ms": "Larva ialah ulat yang mengunyah daun"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
      "TJ:38",
      "TJ:27",
      "WTK:2",
      "UMN-ORD"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
